  - m_Id: 8109452098048000
    m_Localized: Choose Custom, enter a whole number, then press Enter or leave the
      field to apply.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8109452098048001
    m_Localized: Actual frame rate depends on performance. Mobile devices are also
      limited by display refresh rate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8109452098048002
    m_Localized: Each click has a {0:0}% chance to produce tinder.
