  - m_Id: 17033886000000002
    m_Localized: Flick Direction Limit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17033886000000003
    m_Localized: 'Speed and distance: 25%-200%, with 100% as the default. Lower values
      make flick transfers easier.

      With the direction limit on, flick toward
      a target container. With it off, direction still determines the preferred target.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
