  - m_Id: 17033886000000010
    m_Localized: 'Descent controls: WASD moves the ship using power, available engines,
      and fuel. The ship always faces up; its actual position determines the landing
      site.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17923400000000001
    m_Localized: Lightweight (Low-end)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17923400000000002
    m_Localized: 'Lightweight (Low-end): simpler water detail with lower rendering
      cost.'
